WEBVTT

00:06.480 --> 00:07.880
Father

00:08.320 --> 00:09.720
Searched everywhere

00:09.800 --> 00:11.200
Didn't see Chen Wan'er

00:11.600 --> 00:12.800
She thinks

00:12.880 --> 00:14.240
With her little tricks

00:14.320 --> 00:15.480
What can she accomplish?

00:15.600 --> 00:17.120
If not for remembering her father

00:17.280 --> 00:19.613
I could hold her funeral right now

00:20.080 --> 00:21.720
You don't need to search anymore

00:21.800 --> 00:23.467
She can't cause much trouble

00:26.320 --> 00:27.720
Go quickly to the prison

00:27.800 --> 00:28.680
Convey my message

00:28.760 --> 00:30.160
To Prince of Ning

00:30.240 --> 00:31.640
Yes

00:34.000 --> 00:35.400
Prince of Jin

00:35.720 --> 00:37.040
This time

00:37.120 --> 00:38.520
I'm afraid even immortals

00:38.640 --> 00:40.320
Can't save you

00:45.520 --> 00:46.920
Prince of Ning

00:56.600 --> 00:58.267
Didn't expect it, did you?

00:58.520 --> 01:00.520
Father sent me to interrogate you

